<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 24.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 24.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali reviews preparations for 2001 Mediterranean Games at meeting with Youth and Childhood Minister Zouari.</p>
<p>- Parliament adopts communications ministry's 1997 budget.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisian-Algerian statement calls for increasing partnership between businessmen in two countries.</p>
